OL,3,GNEWSANI health trusts to announce 12%
OL,4,Asavings plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland's health and social
OL,7,Fcare trusts are expected to announce
OL,8,Fproposals on how they intend to make
OL,9,Fsavings of up to 12%.
OL,11,FHealth unions have told BBC News NI
OL,12,Fthey understand jobs will be affected
OL,13,Fas the trusts attempt to make the
OL,14,Fsavings.
OL,16,FThose posts could include porter and
OL,17,Fcleaning posts.
OL,19,FUnions are planning to protest later
OL,20,Fthis morning.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
